usage: promote_step7d_mapping.py [-h] [--root ROOT] --bundle BUNDLE
                                 --producer PRODUCER --plan PLAN
                                 --issue1117-log ISSUE1117_LOG
                                 --issue901-log ISSUE901_LOG --config CONFIG
                                 --log LOG --config-sha256 CONFIG_SHA256
                                 --plan-sha256 PLAN_SHA256 [--apply |
                                 --dry-run]

Bounded Step7d projection + native receipt25; dry-run unless --apply. An
externally reviewed, hash-pinned config freezes the actual native candidate
and complete output rows. This operator grants no mapping/release approval.
Canonical and receipt are one native guarded transaction. Policy artifacts
stay historical through receipt24. CLI owns the native lock; callers must do
likewise.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT
  --bundle BUNDLE
  --producer PRODUCER
  --plan PLAN
  --issue1117-log ISSUE1117_LOG
  --issue901-log ISSUE901_LOG
  --config CONFIG
  --log LOG
  --config-sha256 CONFIG_SHA256
  --plan-sha256 PLAN_SHA256
  --apply
  --dry-run
